# Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)

### 1. What dataset is used in this project?
This project uses `Global Economic Data.csv`, covering 6 major economies (USA, Russia, Canada, China, India, Australia) from 2000 to 2023.

### 2. How do I run the Streamlit application?
Make sure you have Python installed, then run the following commands in your terminal:
```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
streamlit run app.py
